{"id":"623332","name":"黄瓜洋葱拌鸡蛋","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623332/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"一根"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒红油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"嫩黄瓜拍一下，切小段。","img":"images/623332/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切小块。","img":"images/623332/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"清水浸泡一会儿，去除辛辣味儿。","img":"images/623332/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮熟的柴鸡蛋，用了三个。","img":"images/623332/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"剥皮，切成片。","img":"images/623332/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"黄瓜，洋葱，鸡蛋摆盘。","img":"images/623332/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香菜，小米椒。","img":"images/623332/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香菜，小米椒放中间。","img":"images/623332/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，米醋，香油，辣椒红油调戓料汁。","img":"images/623332/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"浇到上面即可。","img":"images/623332/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/623332/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}